ublic","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T11:39:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T11:39:31Z","body":"@mime29 no,just waiting for 4.7 to release first, before continuing this ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466728686/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4468522404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-4468522404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":4468522404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABClg9pA","user":{"login":"mime29","id":2211828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE4Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2211828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29","html_url":"https://github.com/mime29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T23:28:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T01:21:41Z","body":"@stuartcarnie Thanks for the feedback.\r\nMeanwhile, on a project that already has iPad and iOS working,\r\nI tested this PR locally by using Export > tvOS, and In xcode I get `/dev/project/xcode/app.xcframework:1:1: While building for tvOS Simulator, no library for this platform was found in '....'.`\r\nI simply exported the PCK to my xcode project folder, made sure tvOS was checked as a target. It looks like the xcframework do not have the lib for the target. something I'm doing wrong?\r\n\r\nThe Target, an old Apple tv 4K\r\n\r\nThe first error:\r\n```\r\nShowing Recent Issues\r\nThe folder “tvos-arm64_arm64e” doesn’t exist.\r\n```\r\n\r\nAI did the following modifications to make the build pass:\r\n\r\n- adding a local tvos-arm64 Godot slice into xcode/app.xcframework\r\n- excluding iOS-only GameCenter, StoreKit2, and MoltenVK frameworks from tvOS builds\r\n- adding a tvOS launch storyboard\r\n- making plugin registration skip iOS plugins on tvOS\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4468522404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756778715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-4756778715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":4756778715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG4au2w","user":{"login":"paulocoutinhox","id":395096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTA5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox","html_url":"https://github.com/paulocoutinhox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T06:53:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T06:53:11Z","body":"I build and make all for AppleTV. I deployed for it but don't work because it is not compatible with my AppleTV version: Apple TV 4K - A1842 - tvOS 26.5.\r\n\r\nIt appear that works only on AppleTV 2021+.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756778715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756998960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-4756998960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":4756998960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG4oLMA","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T08:25:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T08:25:22Z","body":"> I build and make all for AppleTV. I deployed for it but don't work because it is not compatible with my AppleTV version: Apple TV 4K - A1842 - tvOS 26.5.\n> \n> \n> \n> It appear that works only on AppleTV 2021+.\n\n@paulocoutinhox yes, the 1st generation AppleTV has an A10X chip, which is an Apple3 GPU. We require a minimum of an Apple4 GPU for Metal for cubemap support. \n\nWe will add OpenGL support from another PR, which should enable it for your device. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756998960/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":2,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4891485430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-4891485430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":4891485430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI44k9g","user":{"login":"salernoelia","id":98467074,"node_id":"U_kgDOBd59Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98467074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia","html_url":"https://github.com/salernoelia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:59:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:00:56Z","body":"Thanks for the work on this! I found getting no remote input at all isn't very useful for building tvOS apps/games, so I put together a draft patch.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/salernoelia/godot/commit/9031b6fc4f\r\n\r\nTested on an Apple TV 3rd gen with a 3rd gen Siri Remote: buttons arrive as UIPress types, and the focus engine was consuming them before they reached the engine at all, as you likely knew already.\r\n\r\nThe patch maps remote presses (D-Pad, Select, Menu, Play/Pause) to key events, and sets `controllerUserInteractionEnabled = NO`, which I noticed was commented out, I'm guessing to preserve the Menu button behavior? Turning off the focus engine is the tradeoff needed to get input through, though: with it off, Menu no longer auto-exits to Home, it arrives in-app as ESCAPE instead. The TV/Home button worked fine for exiting the app in my testing, but wanted to flag this rather than assume it's the right call...\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4891485430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4904870668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-4904870668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":4904870668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJFpjDA","user":{"login":"salernoelia","id":98467074,"node_id":"U_kgDOBd59Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98467074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia","html_url":"https://github.com/salernoelia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salernoelia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T14:24:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T14:52:49Z","body":"Two more tvOS export issues on top of the remote input one.\r\n\r\nApp icon and Top Shelf export empty. The shared Apple Embedded path writes a flat AppIcon.appiconset, which tvOS ignores. Draft patch generates an AppIcon.brandassets instead:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/salernoelia/godot/commit/fcfd4bc05de49e8729181a41e2f0a1da2561d16d\r\n\r\nLayered image stacks for the small/large app icons, image sets for the two Top Shelf sizes, at 1x and 2x (note: The 2x icons are upscaled from the single 1x source option, so they pass validation but that is sub-optimal, would need a more foundational change). Kept the name AppIcon so ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME still resolves it. Base still creates the appiconset, so the patch removes it to avoid a duplicate AppIcon asset. Image stacks need >=2 layers or actool rejects them, so the icon is on the back layer with a transparent front layer, no parallax, but definitely also worth implementing imo. Dark variants are emitted as luminosity appearances when set. tvOS has no tinted icons so I hid those inherited options rather than leave them dead. xcrun actool --platform appletvos compiles clean and emits an Assets.car.\r\n\r\nInfo.plist fails App Store validation. UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities may not contain values that would exclude any device, but the shared exporter adds iphone-ipad-minimum-performance-a12 (whenever Metal is used) and wifi (an Apple TV can be on Ethernet on certain devices). Draft patch emits only plugin and user capabilities on tvOS, and hides the a12, gaming-tier and wifi options that do not apply.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/salernoelia/godot/commit/12eaae338f124a50a420fadcd6a4101edcbd1384\r\n\r\nBoth commits touch export_plugin.cpp and are stacked, so for reproduction apply the icon one first..","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4904870668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5024877542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-5024877542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":5024877542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK4GL5g","user":{"login":"VSofficial","id":39454933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDU0OTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39454933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial","html_url":"https://github.com/VSofficial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VSofficial/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T16:58:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T17:01:24Z","body":"For running Godot exported project in iOS/tvOS simulator \r\nThe problem isn't Metal itself—which the simulator runs beautifully—but rather a hardware-specific framework (MetalFX) that simply does not exist in a simulated environment.\r\nIf we disable scaling in Godot project or to make it 'Optional' from 'Required' in Xcode. \r\nWill there be possibility to test run on simulator environment?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5024877542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197160333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118332#issuecomment-5197160333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118332","id":5197160333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNcZfjQ","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","re